    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Professor Karim Damji has been appointed as the Dean of the Medical College, Pakistan. A globally respected clinician, academic and leader, Dr Damji brings decades of experience and a longstanding commitment to AKU's mission. He will assume the role on August 11, 2025.",
